{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790506380, "covers_from": "2026-09-27T10:53:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-27T10:54:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790506440, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-27T10:53:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 51309, "sprite_key": "penguin_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "教育", "content": "身為國小生的家長，不認為齊頭式的免費牛奶和營養午餐的政策是好的，反而壓縮了其他教育方面真正的需求。", "display_name": "北投代表 No.51,309", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T10:53:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 37822, "sprite_key": "elephant_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "市政", "content": "我想要的市長，是可以做滿四年，心放在台北，而不是像之前高雄那位，ㄧ選上高雄市長，就馬不停蹄的選總統！", "display_name": "大安代表 No.37,822", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T10:53:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34972, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "環境", "content": "大稻埕碼頭很多觀光客，可不可以花一點心思跟預算把環境弄得好一點？", "display_name": "大同代表 Ted Lai 賴金德", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T10:53:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34436, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "其他", "content": "拜託我的市長沈柏洋，要好好吃飯，不要太累了！！", "display_name": "大安代表 No.34,436", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-27T10:53:49+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 17422, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "其他", "content": "身為城市門面的台北車站，沈市長會怎麼處理北車遊民的問題！", "display_name": "中正代表 No.17,422", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 37822, "sprite_key": "elephant_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.37,822", "district": "daan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 34972, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 Ted Lai 賴金德", "district": "datong